{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A slimy dad on a gooey rescue mission!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/extras/419cf08ae780c5f9a5165a9e52a1bc1d.poster.avif?t=1749227109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/extras/419cf08ae780c5f9a5165a9e52a1bc1d.webm?t=1749227109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/extras/419cf08ae780c5f9a5165a9e52a1bc1d.mp4?t=1749227109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lazy afternoon turns chaotic when a mysterious bucket sucks Gloop\u2019s four mischievous kids into a vibrant, color-filled dimension. Now it's up to him\u2014a lovable slime and single dad\u2014to jump inside, master the art of color shifting, and rescue his quirky children!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/extras/22a60d3c1bec06a87affa4480d5b7e21.poster.avif?t=1749227109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/extras/22a60d3c1bec06a87affa4480d5b7e21.webm?t=1749227109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/extras/22a60d3c1bec06a87affa4480d5b7e21.mp4?t=1749227109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match Gloop\u2019s color to the floors as you carefully navigate each stage. Watch your step, because touching the wrong color spells disaster! Shift between green, red, blue, and yellow by touching buckets filled with colorful ink to safely reach Gloop\u2019s adorable kids and bring them back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/extras/11ccb47ce9a08855856f8bab7cdc6374.poster.avif?t=1749227109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/extras/11ccb47ce9a08855856f8bab7cdc6374.webm?t=1749227109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/extras/11ccb47ce9a08855856f8bab7cdc6374.mp4?t=1749227109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter tricky obstacles. Push boxes matching Gloop\u2019s current color to climb higher platforms, and open locked doors by finding and activating levers of the correct color to advance your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to jump, splash, and slime your way through the ink dimension? Gloop\u2019s family depends on you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes the Megadrive ROM file you can burn and play on your original hardware if you have it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delightful 2D puzzle-platforming action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming, colorful pixel-art visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color-changing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 challenging levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family-friendly story featuring lovable slime characters across numerous cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Time Rewind feature - fix your mistakes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports both 16:9 and 4:3 aspect ratio modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional CRT shader for retro visuals</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sticky Situation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629990/b498f274f22472405522ffc1bc8190126f1c8ea9.jpg"},{"name":"Monette Saved!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629990/107498e574b27bc134bc373a5163302380a37916.jpg"},{"name":"Colorful Quest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629990/de31078fa9ece47aea786aa59db96f64f8fcde6e.jpg"},{"name":"Spike Rescued!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629990/8a41ff7fc14508ef334432f660c5be05cc278e5e.jpg"},{"name":"Feeling Blue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629990/9eb4486f64bcb9e1d093b7e36f0fe14beee7bfc3.jpg"},{"name":"Red Alert!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629990/03bc3da2b04e1cafc8ee595f973e516b0c73974a.jpg"},{"name":"Not-So-Mellow Yellow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629990/c3df0a8245aa59c2d69b11d60fa7f4f02ae78fc8.jpg"},{"name":"Lever Fever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629990/acbe700d714ca63b0b556751f89d763122f15c50.jpg"},{"name":"Familiar Face","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629990/1ce43e244b8d6a4b5f557d2c511e990c2c69a645.jpg"},{"name":"Hello Yellow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3629990/4d7d8eace6e97d9be2f5b1bae285cd762b3f76a7.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3629990?t=1749227109","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/db113e187538457693d4a5266c3dcb0a2f68079b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749227109","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/d3e77fd1f8f621db38fff5b06f224ce3f91a9697/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749227109","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/d3e77fd1f8f621db38fff5b06f224ce3f91a9697/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749227109","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A slimy dad on a gooey rescue mission!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/extras/419cf08ae780c5f9a5165a9e52a1bc1d.poster.avif?t=1749227109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/extras/419cf08ae780c5f9a5165a9e52a1bc1d.webm?t=1749227109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/extras/419cf08ae780c5f9a5165a9e52a1bc1d.mp4?t=1749227109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lazy afternoon turns chaotic when a mysterious bucket sucks Gloop\u2019s four mischievous kids into a vibrant, color-filled dimension. Now it's up to him\u2014a lovable slime and single dad\u2014to jump inside, master the art of color shifting, and rescue his quirky children!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629990/extras/22a60d3c1bec06a87affa4480d5b7e21.poster.avif?t=1749227109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"h